      "text": "San Mateo began in 1768 when Governor Mendinueta granted the San Mateo Spring land to Santiago Duran y Chávez, laying the town’s first water‑centered settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
